WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:03.600
Why doesn't the Earth trust the Moon ?

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.980
Because the Moon never reveals its Dark side.

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:12.180
The Moon has a side which no one can ever see from the Earth,

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:15.700
which is called the Dark side or the Far side.

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:18.820
Let's find out why?

00:00:23.320 --> 00:00:26.180
We know that the Moon rotates about its axis

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.300
and revolves around the Earth.

00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:30.900
But how does this really happen?

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:32.780
For better understanding,

00:00:33.040 --> 00:00:37.400
let's mark the side which can be seen by the Earth in a different color.

00:00:37.840 --> 00:00:40.040
Now many of us imagine the Moon's movement

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.040
to be happening like this.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.140
Rotating about its axis and revolving around the Earth.

00:00:46.660 --> 00:00:50.080
Notice that here, the Moon is completing many rotations

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:53.520
before it completes one complete revolution.

00:00:53.900 --> 00:00:55.520
But that's not how it works;

00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:59.500
which brings us to the most important concept here.

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:03.920
The time taken by the Moon to rotate about its axis once,

00:01:04.240 --> 00:01:09.020
is almost the same as the time it takes to revolve around the Earth once.

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:12.140
Both approximately 27 days!

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:14.900
This gives us the answer.

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:18.660
Here's what actually happens in this time period.

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.720
Notice that the Moon is revolving around the Earth

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:24.800
and rotating about its axis as well.

00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.040
After about half the time period,

00:01:27.280 --> 00:01:28.260
the Moon is here,

00:01:28.360 --> 00:01:31.180
and the Earth has only seen the Near side.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:34.860
And the Moon continues to do so for the remaining time period,

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:39.260
and ends the revolution back at the same point where it started.

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:43.180
In this same time period of around 27 days,

00:01:43.440 --> 00:01:45.380
it rotated once about its axis,

00:01:45.820 --> 00:01:49.500
and revolved once around the Earth as well.

00:01:49.820 --> 00:01:52.180
Let's have a look at this one more time.

00:01:52.540 --> 00:01:54.960
Notice how the Moon is moving!

00:01:55.360 --> 00:01:57.780
We can see that at any point in time,

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:01.600
just one side of the Moon is visible to us from Earth.

00:02:02.640 --> 00:02:07.220
In reality, the Earth is rotating as well as revolving around the Sun.

00:02:07.520 --> 00:02:10.860
But irrespective of that from any point on the Earth,

00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:13.860
only one side of the Moon can be seen!

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:18.740
So now we know why the Earth doesn't trust the Moon.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:21.300
But what about the Earth and the Sun?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:25.860
Is the same concept applicable for them as well?

00:02:26.180 --> 00:02:27.380
No, right !

00:02:27.740 --> 00:02:30.160
We know that the Earth completes one revolution

00:02:30.320 --> 00:02:33.900
around the Sun in approximately 365 days.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:39.660
And what about its rotation? Is that also 365 days?

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:40.640
Nope,

00:02:40.700 --> 00:02:45.560
we're aware that its rotation time is 1 day or 24 hours.

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:48.000
So it's clear now that from the Sun,

00:02:48.140 --> 00:02:51.620
both the sides of the Earth would be visible.

00:02:51.780 --> 00:02:54.220
But what if at some point in the future,

00:02:54.320 --> 00:02:58.220
Earth's rotation time equals its revolution time.

00:02:58.520 --> 00:03:01.360
What do you think would this result in?

00:03:01.720 --> 00:03:03.020
If this happens,

00:03:03.100 --> 00:03:06.960
we know that only one side of the Earth will be exposed to the Sun ,

00:03:07.300 --> 00:03:11.200
while the other side will forever be in darkness.

00:03:11.500 --> 00:03:13.460
What will its implications be?

00:03:13.860 --> 00:03:16.940
How different would our life be on Earth then?

00:03:17.320 --> 00:03:20.040
Well, it's your Kyu Box to explore.

